        <mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Ingress: WAF → public LB → private container&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Containers not exposed to the internet (VPC only)&lt;br&gt;• No VM / bastion / OS patching · CI/CD deploys&lt;br&gt;• No persistent disk – files to S3, state to DB / Redis&lt;br&gt;• Dedibox: secure with token / mTLS (no fixed egress IP)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#B45309&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;• Verify: LB backend → container private endpoint&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;fontColor=#334155;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
